              <td><span class="verdict verdict--ess">No</span></td>
              <td>Service centre or approved marriage officiant</td>
              <td>In person or via agent; AED 220; talaq within 15 days (Article 58).</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Sign a power of attorney abroad</td>
              <td><span class="verdict verdict--ess">No</span></td>
